		(at 169.5 100 180)
		(descr "generic Universal step-down module land pattern (12-24V -> 5V) socket. Generated from modules.json, confidence=USER-SPECIFIED. Source: user spec 2026-08-01, enlarged: modules in this class run from about 22 x 18 to 30 x 18 mm, so the pads are 16 x 10 mm on a 24 / 12 mm grid. That covers module pad spacings of 8-40 mm horizontally and 2-22 mm vertically, i.e. both sizes with room to spare. Outer envelope 40 x 22 mm. Height is capped at 22 by the ESP32-S3's pin rows, which leave a 23.7 mm clear strip on the back.")
